{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5067505239192821880,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Towards reproducibility: pinning Nixpkgs",
      "source_hash": 15475331186043228588,
      "context_hash": 9556666470669857386,
      "translation": "재현성을 향하여: Nixpkgs 고정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs",
        "reproducibility": "재현성",
        "pinning": "고정"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In various Nix examples, you'll often see the following:",
      "source_hash": 15648288386651721802,
      "context_hash": 7427089884392346949,
      "translation": "다양한 Nix 예제에서 다음과 같은 코드를 자주 보게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`<nixpkgs>` points to the file system path of some revision of {term}`Nixpkgs`.",
      "source_hash": 15521726062506807468,
      "context_hash": 3224856946602079788,
      "translation": "`<nixpkgs>`는 {term}`Nixpkgs`의 특정 리비전이 있는 파일 시스템 경로를 가리킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Find more information on [lookup paths](lookup-path-tutorial) in [](reading-nix-language).",
      "source_hash": 6299250990454304661,
      "context_hash": 17330552156293470701,
      "translation": "[조회 경로](lookup-path-tutorial)에 대한 자세한 정보는 [](reading-nix-language)에서 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "This is a **convenient** way to quickly demonstrate a Nix expression and get it working by importing Nix packages.",
      "source_hash": 13582186785649735870,
      "context_hash": 4454870084090554850,
      "translation": "이는 Nix 패키지를 가져와 Nix 표현식을 빠르게 시연하고 동작하게 만드는 **편리한** 방법입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "packages": "패키지",
        "Nix expression": "Nix 표현식",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "However, <ref-search-path>**the resulting Nix expression is not fully reproducible**.",
      "source_hash": 11990637119578948809,
      "context_hash": 627160289899669620,
      "translation": "하지만 <ref-search-path>**이렇게 만든 Nix 표현식은 완전히 재현 가능하지 않습니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix expression": "Nix 표현식",
        "reproducible": "재현 가능"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Pinning packages with URLs inside a Nix expression",
      "source_hash": 7582085408018564809,
      "context_hash": 17467850749760274749,
      "translation": "Nix 표현식 안에서 URL로 패키지 고정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix expression": "Nix 표현식",
        "pinning": "고정",
        "packages": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To create **fully reproducible** Nix expressions, we can pin an exact version of Nixpkgs.",
      "source_hash": 6412670604968004308,
      "context_hash": 17607416573344372854,
      "translation": "**완전히 재현 가능한** Nix 표현식을 만들려면 Nixpkgs의 정확한 버전을 고정하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "reproducible": "재현 가능",
        "Nix expressions": "Nix 표현식",
        "pin": "고정",
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The simplest way to do this is to fetch the required Nixpkgs version as a tarball specified via the relevant Git commit hash:",
      "source_hash": 3245045571362458302,
      "context_hash": 15230864120710868800,
      "translation": "가장 간단한 방법은 필요한 Nixpkgs 버전을 해당 Git 커밋 해시로 지정한 tarball로 가져오는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs",
        "hash": "해시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Picking the commit can be done via [status.nixos.org](https://status.nixos.org/), which lists all the releases and the latest commit that has passed all tests.",
      "source_hash": 11367646404555784725,
      "context_hash": 7437803797207243154,
      "translation": "커밋은 [status.nixos.org](https://status.nixos.org/)에서 고를 수 있으며, 이 사이트에는 모든 릴리스와 모든 테스트를 통과한 최신 커밋이 나열되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "When choosing a commit, it is recommended to follow either",
      "source_hash": 10860473316560445475,
      "context_hash": 5420538545241676293,
      "translation": "커밋을 고를 때는 다음 중 하나를 따르는 것을 권장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235783Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "the **latest stable NixOS** release by using a specific version, such as `nixos-21.05`, **or**",
      "source_hash": 15463013396765577773,
      "context_hash": 11151337888401734156,
      "translation": "`nixos-21.05`처럼 특정 버전을 사용하여 **최신 안정 NixOS** 릴리스를 따르거나, **또는**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NixOS": "NixOS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235783Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "the latest **unstable release** via `nixos-unstable`.",
      "source_hash": 3716930007080245991,
      "context_hash": 14134672757768154663,
      "translation": "`nixos-unstable`을 통해 최신 **불안정 릴리스**를 따릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235783Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Next steps",
      "source_hash": 16066775224842874840,
      "context_hash": 2583239766793953905,
      "translation": "다음 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235783Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For more examples and details of the different ways to pin `nixpkgs`, see {ref}`ref-pinning-nixpkgs`.",
      "source_hash": 9429257023002789586,
      "context_hash": 6083165476028358887,
      "translation": "`nixpkgs`를 고정하는 다양한 방법에 대한 더 많은 예제와 자세한 내용은 {ref}`ref-pinning-nixpkgs`를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pin": "고정"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T14:03:31.235783Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[](dependency-management-npins)",
      "source_hash": 1674558113802037584,
      "context_hash": 12935802442697365533,
      "translation": "[](dependency-management-npins)",
